{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And I will set My face, etc.</b> One needs to know what place there is for this punishment, given that there is a tribunal below and they will stone him with stones?" "<b>And it will appear</b> that the verse informs us that besides the punishment of execution, there will yet be a punishment for the soul, and that is His saying <b>and I will cut him off from among his people</b> — meaning, from the branch of the shoot of holiness. And the verse gives a reason for these two punishments and says <b>because of his seed</b>, etc., <b>to defile</b>, completing the phrase, <b>and to profane</b>, etc. — here are two blemishes, and corresponding to them, two punishments: corresponding to the defilement of the Sanctuary they shall stone him with stones, and corresponding to the profanation of His holy Name, he too shall be profaned and his soul cut off from its people."], :book :leviticus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:59:48.184458291Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}